<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar closes flat at 476/477 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar closes flat at 476/477 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed flat at 476.00/477.00 per dollar in a quiet session, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The exchange rate was truly serene,&quot; said one. &quot;Central Bank intervention was extremely light, as was corporate demand.&quot;</p>
<p>Similar trade is seen for forthcoming sessions, brokers added.</p>
<p>((--Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
